# Thirty background pages put to sleep: the timed pass no unit test reaches with a real page,
# run here with a one-second threshold (cra://debug?sleepTabs) instead of waiting an hour.
budget rss=800 stalls50=50   # each new tab stalls ~100 ms today (Nov 2026)
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=first
wait 3
helpers baseline
pace 0.3
repeat 30 cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=${i}
cra://action/nextTab
wait 4
cra://debug?sleepTabs=1
wait 4
expect-log tab sleep unloads
helpers settle 2
